{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>LoopCam 把 iPhone 前置鏡頭變成免手持動作計數工具，適合想按自己課表訓練、又不想分心手動計數的 iPhone 用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-10.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂課表與免手持計數</h2>\n<p>LoopCam 把 iPhone 前置鏡頭變成免手持動作計數工具，可在自訂訓練組設定每組次數與備註，或依動作、組別編排課表。訓練時顯示大型即時次數，並以進度格標示已完成與待做項目；張開手掌可開始或繼續，手勢或螢幕按鈕可暫停，語音次數提示協助跟上節奏。另備自由模式，姿勢分析在 iPhone 本機進行，不需帳號。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-6-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-7-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-8-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：LoopCam: AR workout counter</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/loopcam-ar-workout-counter/id6772089467?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:21:26.827345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:33.709680+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:05.776612+00:00","content_hash":"88d26a0f90e4cfdce293d672d1e12dd2ade20b4203707f5f7c71788fc0fce58c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}